# Helpers

## Conventions

- Keep helpers focused on view-layer formatting
- Use helpers for repeated view logic (formatting dates, currencies, status badges)
- Avoid business logic in helpers - that belongs in models or services
- Prefer ViewComponent for complex reusable UI elements

